description	"Jedi Traditionalist

A master who eschews dueling prowess in favor of superior blaster countering. Deflects deal increased damage.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 50% less damage
-- 30% slower RoF
- Lightsaber (Yellow/Blue/Red)
-- Saber Defense (2)
-- Blaster Defense/Deflect (3)
-- 42% less Red/8% more Blue damage
-- 25% more special damage
-- EX Saber Throw (2) ^3[CS1]
--- 33% more damage

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (2)
- Push (2)
- Pull (1)
- Sense (3)
- Absorb (1) ^3[CS2]

^8Attributes:
- Healing (1)
- Force Block/Focus (1)
- 10% faster skill cooldown"